    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2024-12-15"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2028-06-15"></period-end>
     <target value="9.5">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">As intended, the implementation of Ministerial Agreement No. 937 contributed to containing public wage bill growth by imposing limits on staffing expansion, resulting in a reduction of the wage bill by 0.5 percentage points of GDP. The Government has continued to communicate its commitment to advancing the formulation of the Human Resource Law under the Programmatic Series, which is expected to further alleviate the wage bill burden by aligning compensation adjustments with the fiscal consolidation path and promoting sustainable management of the public workforce.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="10.0"></actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
